I think this covers the requirements for part 2, there is data validation on how much eth balance can be added and checks to see if the user can afford
the nft they are trying to buy as well as account for people trying to enter negative numbers. Also a user cannot mint an nft with the same name or image as an NFT already in
the database. The search bar works by just checking if the substring exists at all the the name of the nft and if it does it will show that record.

I did not go too crazy with debugging and checking everything as it is late and that took longer than I thought it would.

Make sure this works on your end and you should definitely test it with multiple users and to make sure it works correctly.

